  https://github.com/alganzory/HaramBlur

  HaramBlur demonstrated that frame-by-frame, on-device gaze
  protection inside video is achievable in a browser, and it shaped
  the design of this project's gaze module.

  NO CODE FROM HaramBlur IS USED IN THIS PROJECT, AND NONE MAY BE
